===Jurisdiction of the Arbitration Committee===
3) The Arbitration Committee [[Wikipedia:Arbitration/Policy#Jurisdiction|has jurisdiction]] over conduct on the English Wikipedia and retains jurisdiction over all matters previously heard, including associated enforcement processes. While the Arbitration Committee may take notice of behavior outside of the English Wikipedia, it cannot restrict behavior which occurs outside of the English Wikipedia.

