:# No objection to starting a review at the request of an admin. No objection to the sunset clause - but I'd rather be reactive in this instance. [[User:Worm That Turned|<b style="color:var(--color-base);">''Worm''</b>]]<sup>TT</sup>([[User talk:Worm That Turned|<b style="color:#060;">talk</b>]]) 08:48, 20 January 2025 (UTC)

:Abstain:
