:# I'm just really reluctant to make subcommittees with arbitrators here. I could possibly envision it with a group of seasoned admins, though. <span style="color: #9932CC">[[:User:KrakatoaKatie|Katie]]<sup>[[User talk:KrakatoaKatie|talk]]</sup></span> 18:48, 14 January 2025 (UTC) 
